+/* -------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ * PS4 TLS trace
+ *
+ * Create /data/kodi-ps4/tls-trace (or set PS4_TLS_TRACE=1) to log the
+ * OpenSSL handshake messages with monotonic timestamps.  This separates
+ * TCP connect, CA/SSL_CTX setup, ClientHello, ServerHello, certificate
+ * verification and Finished without a packet capture.
