+/* Opened once at install time.  A SIGSEGV handler must not depend on open()
+ * succeeding while another thread is inside the filesystem (PFS) or while the
+ * faulting stack is unusable; the 0.1.1q crash (ExceptionCode 11) produced no
+ * signal entry because the handler could not open the log in time.  O_APPEND
+ * keeps writes from different threads atomic. */
